  "translation": "I got up at seven this morning. I first put on my clothes, then went to the kitchen. On the table there were bread and milk. Mom was cooking. She asked me, 'What do you eat?' I said, 'I eat bread and eggs.' I ate two eggs. I drink milk, and mom also drinks milk. At eight, I left home. I took the bus to school. At school I attended class. The teacher taught us Chinese. I can speak a little Chinese. At noon, I ate with classmates together at a restaurant. In the afternoon, I went home. After going home, I first did my homework. Then I watched TV for a while. In the evening, I watched a movie with dad. The movie was very good. At ten, I slept. Today I was very happy. This bread is very tasty."
